  #line-at(166.49pt, 323.45pt, "Abstract: ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(205.13pt, 323.45pt, "This paper presents a novel methodology for detecting faults in wind turbine blades using ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 336.41pt, "computational learning techniques. The study evaluates two models: the first employs logistic re-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 349.49pt, "gression, which outperformed neural networks, decision trees, and the naive Bayes method, demon-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 362.45pt, "strating its effectiveness in identifying fault-related patterns. The second model leverages clustering ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 375.41pt, "and achieves superior performance in terms of precision and data segmentation. The results indicate ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 388.49pt, "that clustering may better capture the underlying data characteristics compared to supervised meth-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 401.45pt, "ods. The proposed methodology offers a new approach to early fault detection in wind turbine ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 414.41pt, "blades, highlighting the potential of integrating different computational learning techniques to en-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 427.49pt, "hance system reliability. The use of accessible tools like Orange Data Mining underscores the prac-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 440.47pt, "tical application of these advanced solutions within the wind energy sector. Future work will focus ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 453.43pt, "on combining these methods to improve detection accuracy further and extend the application of ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 466.51pt, "these techniques to other critical components in energy infrastructure. ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(167.09pt, 491.47pt, "Keywords: ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(214.01pt, 491.47pt, "wind turbine; artificial intelligence; blade failures; energy; sustainability; Orange Data ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 504.43pt, "Mining ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(167.09pt, 556.15pt, "1. Introduction ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(188.45pt, 571.87pt, "In recent decades, wind power has emerged as a crucial source of clean and sustain-")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 584.71pt, "able energy generation [1], playing a key role in reducing greenhouse gas emissions and ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 597.55pt, "facilitating the transition to a more sustainable energy matrix. Wind turbines have become ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 610.39pt, "essential components of the energy infrastructure, efficiently harnessing wind power to ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 623.26pt, "generate electricity in an environmentally friendly manner. Within the operation and ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 635.98pt, "maintenance of these turbines, the blades play a crucial role in converting the kinetic en-")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 648.82pt, "ergy of the wind into mechanical energy, ultimately transforming it into electricity [2]. ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 661.66pt, "However, these massive structures face inherent challenges due to constant exposure to ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 674.5pt, "extreme weather forces, dynamic loads, and structural fatigue [3]. Consequently, the ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 687.34pt, "blades are susceptible to various types of wear and damage throughout their service life, ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 700.06pt, "impacting their performance and, consequently, the efficiency of the entire turbine [4]. ")
  #line-at(188.45pt, 712.9pt, "The early and accurate detection of wind turbine blade failures has become a crucial ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 725.74pt, "priority to ensure the reliability, operational safety, and economic viability of wind farms ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 738.58pt, "[5], given that wind turbine blades represent 20% of the total cost of the wind turbine [6]. ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 751.416pt, "As the wind industry continues to expand and mature, various innovative techniques and ")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 764.136pt, "approaches to fault detection have been developed and adopted, opening new opportu-")
  #line-at(167.09pt, 776.976pt, "nities to improve the efficiency and sustainability of wind power generation. ")
