  #line-at(182.69pt, 117.26pt, "strikes, Lightning attachment, and Lightning ")
  #line-at(238.73pt, 130.7pt, "protection systems. ")
  #line-at(386.98pt, 110.54pt, "Advances in Lightning Protection Sys-")
  #line-at(461.38pt, 123.98pt, "tems ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 144.74pt, "This manuscript aims to contribute to the existing knowledge and understanding of ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 157.58pt, "wind turbine blade failure detection by addressing gaps identified in the current litera-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 170.3pt, "ture. The integration of sensor data, advanced data analysis techniques, and visual inspec-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 183.14pt, "tion using unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs), together with a comparative study of differ-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 195.98pt, "ent data analysis models, decision trees, naive Bayes, neural networks, logistic regression, ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 208.82pt, "and hierarchical clustering, improves the accuracy, efficiency, and sustainability of wind ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 221.66pt, "turbine failure detection. The aim of this holistic approach is to optimize the efficiency and ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 234.38pt, "durability of wind energy systems, thus facilitating the transition to a cleaner and more ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 247.22pt, "sustainable energy source.")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.49pt, 272.09pt, "2. Materials and Methods ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(187.73pt, 287.93pt, "Wind power generation plays a crucial role in transitioning to renewable energy ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 300.77pt, "sources. However, wind turbines are exposed to adverse environmental conditions that ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 313.61pt, "can lead to wear and failure of critical components such as blades. Early detection of these ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 326.33pt, "anomalies is essential to ensure the efficient operation and safety of wind turbines. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 339.17pt, "Wind turbine blades are subject to mechanical stresses and variable weather condi-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 352.01pt, "tions, which can result in cracks, deformations, or even fractures. Early detection of these ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 364.85pt, "failures is essential to avoid costly interruptions in power generation and to ensure the ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 377.69pt, "safety of the infrastructure. Conventional inspection techniques often require periodic, ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 390.41pt, "manual shutdowns, which entails additional costs and limits the frequency of revisions. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 403.25pt, "Early detection of blade failures not only contributes to the operational efficiency of ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 416.09pt, "wind turbines but also reduces costs associated with unplanned maintenance and exten-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 428.93pt, "sive repairs. In addition, worker safety is enhanced by minimizing the need for physical ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 441.79pt, "inspections in potentially hazardous conditions, such as high altitudes and harsh weather ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 454.51pt, "environments. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 467.35pt, "Currently, techniques and methods for digital image processing are widely used to ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 480.19pt, "manipulate, extract, enhance, or represent features from a human perspective. The pri-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 493.03pt, "mary tool used in digital image processing is mathematics, often complemented by vari-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 505.87pt, "ous disciplines such as computer science, artificial intelligence, machine learning, com-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 518.59pt, "puter vision, control, optimization, electrical engineering, and biology. These techniques ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 531.43pt, "and methods are implemented in a wide range of applications, including UAVs in aero-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 544.27pt, "nautics [30], object observation and exploration in robotics [31], simulation and animation ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 557.11pt, "[32], diagnosis [33], and evaluation without the need for invasive methods [34], among ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 569.95pt, "others. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 582.67pt, "In this work, 100 images of wind turbine blades were used, taken from a wind farm ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 595.51pt, "located in the Universidad del Istmo area in the Mexican state of Oaxaca. These images ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 608.35pt, "include both damaged and undamaged blades. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 621.22pt, "A digital image is a two-dimensional array or matrix representing the discrete sam-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 634.06pt, "pling of a continuous signal, where each cell of the matrix is called a pixel and may be ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 646.78pt, "constructed of one or multiple channels [35]. Mathematically, such a two-dimensional ar-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 659.62pt, "ray can be represented by the Equation (1). ")
