#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, (image("graphics/page-07.png", width: 526.5pt), 34.5pt, 67.5pt))[
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(36pt, 59.4pt, "Appl. Sci. ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 8.04pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(69.984pt, 59.4pt, "2024")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(86.064pt, 59.4pt, ",")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(87.984pt, 59.4pt, " 14")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(98.064pt, 59.4pt, ", x FOR PEER REVIEW ")
  #line-at(532.44pt, 59.4pt, "7 of 21 ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.49pt, 102.26pt, "together data points that are deemed to be similar, based on the similarities or differences ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 115.1pt, "that they exhibit. Algorithms such as K-means create clusters by assigning data points to ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 127.94pt, "groups (where each group represents a cluster) based on their proximity to a centroid. ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 140.66pt, "Clustering is a commonly employed technique in a number of domains, including market ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 153.5pt, "segmentation, document grouping, image segmentation, and more.")
  #line-at(471.82pt, 153.5pt, "Furthermore, unsu-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 166.34pt, "pervised learning entails the identification of associations between elements within a ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 179.18pt, "given dataset. To illustrate, market basket analysis uncovers the associations between ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 192.02pt, "items that are frequently purchased together [40].43]. Dimensionality reduction is also a ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 204.74pt, "key unsupervised learning technique. A further crucial element is that of dimensionality ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 217.58pt, "reduction, which is designed to diminish the number of features or dimensions in the da-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 230.42pt, "taset [41]. Techniques such as PCA (principal component analysis) facilitate the simplifi-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 243.26pt, "cation of data representation while ensuring the preservation of essential information [42]. ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(166.49pt, 268.13pt, "2.2. Image Acquisition ")
  #set text(font: "Palatino Linotype", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(187.73pt, 283.85pt, "Image acquisition is a crucial component in developing unsupervised learning pro-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 296.69pt, "jects, as the quality and diversity of the input data directly affect the effectiveness and ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 309.53pt, "robustness of the resulting models. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 322.37pt, "This research focuses on obtaining a diversified and representative dataset, which is ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 335.21pt, "essential for training models that can effectively generalize to new situations and contexts. ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 347.93pt, "Through a combination of data sources, including in situ captured images and collections ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 360.77pt, "from existing databases, a robust dataset has been created to drive this project. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 373.61pt, "Additionally, the technical and logistical aspects of image acquisition, such as image ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 386.45pt, "resolution, lighting conditions, and subject variability, are discussed as fundamental fac-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 399.29pt, "tors to ensure data quality. Image preprocessing techniques, such as normalization and ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 412.01pt, "noise reduction, which prepare the data for subsequent analysis, are also addressed. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 424.85pt, "With the growing processing capacity and access to large volumes of data, unsuper-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 437.69pt, "vised learning has the potential to uncover complex patterns and relationships in the data ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 450.55pt, "that might not be evident otherwise. ")
  #line-at(187.73pt, 463.39pt, "The images were acquired using an unmanned aerial vehicle equipped with a ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 476.11pt, "ZENMUSE H20 thermal camera that can take one RGB photograph and one thermal pho-")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 488.95pt, "tograph; see Figure 3. ")
]

