  #line-at(187.73pt, 606.67pt, "As shown in Table 2, the learning model that fits the best is logistic regression, which ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 619.54pt, "has a value of 0.878 in the area under the ROC (AUC) evaluation, which is defined as the ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 632.38pt, "area under the receiver operating curve. Classification accuracy (CA) is the proportion of ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 645.1pt, "correctly classified examples. F-1 is a weighted harmonic mean of precision and recall. ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 657.94pt, "Precision is the proportion of true positives among instances classified as positive. Recall ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 670.78pt, "is the proportion of true positives among all positive instances in the data. The Matthews ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 683.62pt, "correlation coefficient (MCC) takes into account true and false positives and negatives and ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 696.46pt, "is generally regarded as a balanced measure which can be used even if the classes are of ")
  #line-at(166.49pt, 709.18pt, "very different sizes. ")
